# Modelfile
# Optional step up for a 16 GB laptop: a 32k-context copy of ministral-3:8b.
# Course kit, module 16
#
# The default path runs on Gemini's free tier and needs no Modelfile. This one is
# for the optional local run. OpenCode talks to Ollama through its OpenAI-style
# endpoint, and that endpoint does not pass a context length, so bake it in:
#   ollama pull ministral-3:8b
#   ollama create ministral-3:8b-32k -f Modelfile   # optional step up, 16 GB laptop
# Then check it took:  ollama ps   (look at CONTEXT and PROCESSOR)

FROM ministral-3:8b

# 32,768 tokens: enough for the contract, one file and one test (optional, 16 GB laptop).
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
